03:15.220 --> 03:18.590
I was brought here so abruptly, so I don't know what's what. {naniganandaka 【何が何だか】-what's what}

03:19.490 --> 03:22.050
Hey, you better not be bullshitting us, Echizen!{...be kidding me...}

03:23.190 --> 03:25.180
