05:07.080 --> 05:08.410
15-0.

05:13.880 --> 05:15.560
Don't mind, senpai. {It's fine, senpai.}

05:15.560 --> 05:16.520
Yeah.

05:21.550 --> 05:25.050
<i>The probability of a serve to the left side is 91%.</i>

05:27.620 --> 05:28.340
What!?

05:28.340 --> 05:29.140
The opposite again?

05:30.000 --> 05:31.160
30-0.

05:32.580 --> 05:34.600
Renji, you...

05:36.290 --> 05:37.560
Let's go, Sadaharu.

05:38.480 --> 05:43.650
This time, I'm certain that the probability of a serve to the right side is 99%.

05:47.280 --> 05:48.530
<i>As I thought, it's the opposite.</i>

05:53.790 --> 05:56.120
Kaidoh, a drop shot's coming. Move forward!

05:56.120 --> 05:57.250
Yes!

05:59.570 --> 06:01.000
<i>What!?</i>

06:01.000 --> 06:02.250
Short Snake!

06:02.250 --> 06:03.710
Hey, stop bullshitting me!

06:05.730 --> 06:06.820
40-0.

06:11.350 --> 06:13.760
A weakling should act like one. {Small fry should act like one.} {Zako= small fry, but can we use other words like useless / weakling here?}

06:14.510 --> 06:19.370
That bastard Kirihara used Kaidoh's finishing move so easily. {finishing moves}

06:19.370 --> 06:22.480
