06:51.130 --> 06:54.760
I have registered all data concerning you.

06:54.760 --> 06:58.990
I have complete confidence in the numbers calculated from that. {I prefer: I have complete confidence from the numbers analysed from it. Even though hajikidasu= calculate}

06:58.990 --> 07:00.850
And yet, you...

07:00.850 --> 07:03.730
For the sake of our childhood friendship, I'll tell you. {osananajimi = childhood friends; yoshimi = friendship; can I just say childhood friendship?}

07:04.270 --> 07:11.540
Sadaharu, it seems that you don't understand 
the weight of continuing to reign as kings. {other options: 君臨kunrin=  to reign; to dictate; to control}

07:11.540 --> 07:15.080
Weight of continuing to reign as kings?

07:18.840 --> 07:21.360
For us, who have been called invincible, {常勝joushou= invincible. Alternative this 上昇 joushou=rising; ascending}

07:21.360 --> 07:24.750
losing at the national tournament is absolutely unforgivable.

07:24.970 --> 07:28.540
{07:25-07:28}The defeat we experienced at the Kantou District Tournament...  {吉祥kishou-lucky omen, auspicious- here I used befit/ saving grace}

07:28.540 --> 07:32.510
{07:29-07:32}increased our determination for victory. {douryokusa o youritsu = supported our motivation power/ dynamic force; I used,determination [from motivation power]}

07:33.290 --> 07:35.430
You have no chance of winning.

07:35.860 --> 07:40.250
Goodness! Devouring weaklings like you will leave a bad aftertaste.{This hagotae 【歯ごたえ ・ 歯応え】 =feel [consistency] of food while being chewed. But weird? Can I use substance/ skills instead? Please check}{also, motto mashi= more better/ more preferable or just what I used?}

07:40.250 --> 07:42.100
Play better tennis!

07:42.100 --> 07:43.840
What did you say, bastard!?

07:43.840 --> 07:45.930
Don't get caught in their pace.

07:45.930 --> 07:48.280
Data errors will be covered up with data.

07:48.280 --> 07:49.070
