07:49.610 --> 07:52.160
We have our way of doing things.

07:52.160 --> 07:55.030
What we've done to get this far... Believe in our doubles. {...believe in...}

07:56.090 --> 07:57.950
Our doubles?

07:57.950 --> 07:58.910
That's right.

07:58.910 --> 08:01.370
