09:57.690 --> 10:00.450
{ambient: split here}I'll show you the real Snake!

10:02.370 --> 10:04.210
I forgot to mention something.

10:04.210 --> 10:04.910
Sadaharu,

10:04.910 --> 10:08.500
the Tornado Snake isn't effective against that red-eyed guy. {Tornado snake doesn't work on that guy with red-eyes.}

10:11.960 --> 10:12.980
Watch out!

10:17.580 --> 10:19.220
Are you all right, senpai?

10:30.440 --> 10:31.650
This is bad.

10:31.650 --> 10:33.080
{ambient: split here}Kirihara's eyes are...

10:33.080 --> 10:33.900
When did he...

