Should I lend these to Inui?

11:11.570 --> 11:13.480
Yours are fake glasses, right?

11:13.480 --> 11:15.980
That's true. I forgot.

11:22.200 --> 11:25.020
So many of the same glasses.

11:34.800 --> 11:38.590
<i>I will take red-eyed Kirihara's data into consideration.</i>

11:41.550 --> 11:43.800
If your plan is to shake me up,

11:43.800 --> 11:46.420
I'll slice through it with my tennis!

11:48.720 --> 11:51.140
It's Waterfall again!

11:51.140 --> 11:53.560
<i>Like I said, Waterfall won't work.</i>

11:55.110 --> 11:56.190
<i>What?</i>

11:56.190 --> 11:58.270
