14:17.500 --> 14:21.670
Isn't our doubles making the impossible possible!?

14:22.990 --> 14:25.840
Making the impossible possible...

14:27.470 --> 14:31.180
I am right here: the one who believed and followed you.

14:39.250 --> 14:40.980
That's true.

14:50.740 --> 14:54.950
Angle of incidence is 45 degrees, and the speed is approximately 186 km/h.  {入射角nyuushakaku=angle of incidence}

