What's with that lenient ball?

14:59.120 --> 15:02.380
That must be Inui backing off from his attacks. {Please confirm is it: happou sagari- backing off his attacks, or happōfusagari 【八方塞がり】=cornered}{TL Check: please check this line for accuracy.}

15:02.380 --> 15:03.840
No.

15:03.840 --> 15:06.500
Geez, what a boring guy!{He referred to them as food earlier, so I think he said 薫りaroma/taste here. But "What a bland guy" would sound strange. So I used boring.}

15:06.500 --> 15:08.260
Go with a bang, Kaidoh!

15:08.260 --> 15:09.680
<i>Make the impossible... possible!</i>

15:09.680 --> 15:11.280
<i>Make the impossible... possible!</i>

15:13.140 --> 15:15.050
I told you Tornado won't work-

15:17.220 --> 15:18.390
What!?

15:18.390 --> 15:20.560
Just now, could that be...

15:21.940 --> 15:27.530
With the Tornado Snake stance, he shot Yagyu's Laser Beam? {Please confirm. Is Yagyuu here, a name or buffalo [ 野牛]}

