15:39.650 --> 15:43.220
For Kaidoh's Laser Beam to succeed,

15:43.220 --> 15:47.670
Inui purposely set Kirihara up to return that shot from the baseline.

15:47.670 --> 15:50.100
The match progresses because of his minute calculations.

15:50.100 --> 15:52.380
Inui's Data Tennis has activated.

15:52.990 --> 15:54.970
Because of you my eyes were opened.

15:54.970 --> 15:56.850
Thanks, Kaidoh.

15:56.850 --> 15:57.770
Not at all.

15:57.770 --> 15:59.560
From here on, we're counter-attacking.

16:05.970 --> 16:07.610
30-0.

16:10.630 --> 16:11.700
40-0.

16:12.490 --> 16:13.850
This is bad.

16:13.850 --> 16:16.910
{ambient: split here}At this point, even the Tornado Snake can clinch it.

16:16.910 --> 16:20.840
From the same stance, he can unleash two balls with different speed.

16:20.840 --> 16:23.120
They can't be killed off easily. {He said 死亡例shibourei-incident of death; fatal case. I used killed off}

16:23.120 --> 16:25.580
<i>We, Rikkai, will not lose twice!{Our Rikkai will not lose twice.}</i>

16:28.000 --> 16:31.300
<i>We've got to beat these guys and stand at the pinnacle of the nationals.</i>

16:32.500 --> 16:34.380
<i>Shit! What is it this time!?</i>

16:36.590 --> 16:37.720
It's the Snake!

16:38.500 --> 16:39.720
I don't know!

16:51.370 --> 16:53.250
Fifteen minutes have passed.

16:53.730 --> 16:54.900
{ambient: split here}Get up!

16:57.350 --> 17:00.280
Fifteen minutes have passed. Get up!

17:00.280 --> 17:02.200
{ambient: split here}You red-eyed bastard! {or keep it as Wakame bastard?}

17:12.890 --> 17:15.470
Should I dye you red as well?

17:21.850 --> 17:23.640
W-What's with that person?

17:24.850 --> 17:25.940
He's like the devil.

17:32.230 --> 17:34.150
This is interesting, isn't it?

17:34.150 --> 17:35.190
I accept your challenge.

17:35.190 --> 17:37.470
Too bad, Viper.

17:37.470 --> 17:40.560
I won't be aiming at you.

17:40.560 --> 17:41.990
