18:24.840 --> 18:26.870
I don't want to see you injured.

18:28.300 --> 18:30.040
No way...

18:30.500 --> 18:31.820
S-Senpai.

18:31.820 --> 18:34.050
S-Senpai.

18:34.050 --> 18:34.090
S-Senpai.

18:34.230 --> 18:37.090
<b><i>You want stamina that will not lose out to anyone?</i></b>

18:37.090 --> 18:39.340
<b><i>Then follow this menu.</i></b>

18:38.010 --> 18:41.930
<b><i>The key to the completion of your Boomerang Snake is there.</i></b>

18:40.800 --> 18:44.070
<b><i>Will you team up with me for doubles?</i></b>

18:42.890 --> 18:46.520
<b><i>Kaidoh, your emotional strength has improved again.</i></b>

18:47.410 --> 18:48.940
Please stop.

19:05.790 --> 19:09.710
Stop this!

19:21.550 --> 19:22.850
No, Kaidoh!

19:22.850 --> 19:24.350
Don't lose sight of yourself!

19:36.920 --> 19:39.610
Don't do it, Kaidoh.

19:42.840 --> 19:45.580
